<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <style>
        body { background-color: #f4f7f6; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        .wrapper { width: 100%; table-layout: fixed; background-color: #f4f7f6; padding-bottom: 40px; }
        .main { background-color: #ffffff; margin: 0 auto; width: 100%; max-width: 600px; border-spacing: 0; font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; color: #4a4a4a; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; margin-top: 20px; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
        .header { background-color: #2d3436; padding: 40px; text-align: center; color: #ffffff; }
        .content { padding: 40px; line-height: 1.6; }
        .btn-container { text-align: center; padding: 20px 0; }
        .button { background-color: #0984e3; color: #ffffff !important; padding: 15px 30px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px; display: inline-block; }
        .token-section { background-color: #f9f9f9; border-left: 4px solid #0984e3; padding: 15px; margin: 20px 0; word-break: break-all; font-family: monospace; font-size: 13px; color: #636e72; }
        .footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: #b2bec3; }
        h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrapper">
        <table class="main">
            <tr>
                <td class="header">
                    <h1>Note-App 📝</h1>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td class="content">
                    <p>Hi <strong>{{userName}}</strong>,</p>
                    <p>Welcome to <strong>Note-App</strong>! Your personal space to capture ideas, organize tasks, and stay productive.</p>
                    <p>To get started, please verify your email address by clicking the button below:</p>
                    
                    <div class="btn-container">
                        <a href="{{frontendUrl}}/verify-email?token={{token}}" class="button">Verify Email Address</a>
                    </div>

                    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #636e72;">Or copy and paste this link in your browser:</p>
                    <div class="token-section">
                       {{frontendUrl}}/verify-email?token={{token}}&email={{email}}
                    </div>

                    <p>This verification link will expire in <strong>{{expiry}}</strong>.</p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td class="footer">
                    <p>&copy; 2026 Note-App Inc. | Karachi, Pakistan</p>
                    <p>If you didn't create an account, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
                </td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    </div>
</body>
</html>